      "rule": "same_calendar_day_same_type_one_to_one",
      "explanation": "A planned foreign sport appointment counts as fulfilled when an activity of the same type, compared by type id and never by name, is recorded on the same calendar day. One activity fulfils at most one appointment. An appointment today without an activity is upcoming until the day ends and counts as missed from the next day on. fulfilmentRatio is fulfilled divided by fulfilled plus missed; upcoming and cancelled appointments are not in the denominator. These numbers are separate from the template adherence fields (plannedCount, matchedCount and the others), which count template trainings only; toleranceDays does not apply to foreign sport."
    },
    "removedWithCompletedSessionCount": 0,
    "removedWithCompletedSessionDates": [],
    "removedWithCompletedSessionExplanation": "removedWithCompletedSessionCount counts the dates in this window that stand in the removed dates of a recurring template appointment although a finished session of the same template lies on that calendar day. Until the app fix of phase 155 the app wrote such a date when the athlete completed a series appointment, so these dates are included in removedOccurrenceCount although they were done, not cancelled. removedOccurrenceCount itself is unchanged; read these dates as completed rather than cancelled."
